No Bitcoin Core C++ source is present in this module. `base58.zig`'s
multiply-add algorithm is clean-room from the well-known Base58/Base58Check
description (see the module doc comment). What is reproduced here, and only
here, is conformance DATA — which is precisely why the notice lives beside
it.
